http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Options#videocolors

As that says, videocolors is only available if your copy of NetHack was
compiled with NO_TERMS. You can check this by viewing #version.
If it shows "screen control via foo" where foo is one of mactty, BIOS,
DJGPP fast, VGA graphics or WIN32 console I/O, then your NetHack
does support videocolors.  Otherwise you want to change your terminal
colors.

